  "description": "Code-first gRPC transport binding and client-safe client for Orleans.Lattice.Api.Telemetry. Exposes the read-only telemetry facade (curated named-query catalogue discovery and query evaluation by id) as a routable per-region gRPC surface, with a default-deny authorization interceptor, a caller-credential bridge, and an unauthenticated auth-scheme discovery RPC. Transport only: the effective tenant stays derived server-side by the facade, which remains the single enforcement point. References the shared contract package alone, so a desktop or web client head can consume telemetry without taking the MCP server surface.",
